{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introductory cutscenes for four key NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided tutorial to introduce core gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greenhouse for growing and nurturing herbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infirmary where you craft remedies and treat adventurers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredient shop for purchasing herbal components</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorable forest biome with gatherable reagents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the Role of a Healer in a Relaxing Fantasy World</strong> In this charming life-simulation game, you\u2019ve been invited by the Adventurer\u2019s Guild to manage a cozy infirmary in a vibrant village. Unwind as you explore lush landscapes, nurture your garden, and connect with the community at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Soothing Remedies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/3aee08caa7701a2f985faf50abda7a42.poster.avif?t=1759344332\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/3aee08caa7701a2f985faf50abda7a42.webm?t=1759344332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help adventurers recover after their journeys by crafting remedies from unique ingredients. Match reagent properties to enhance their potency, or simply enjoy the process of experimenting with new combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Connections</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/a64c08f22fc78893133645bded24ff3a.poster.avif?t=1759344332\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/a64c08f22fc78893133645bded24ff3a.webm?t=1759344332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time getting to know your neighbors through meaningful conversations and leisurely quests. Discover their stories, form friendships, and perhaps find romance along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cultivate Your Herbal Garden</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/18ccf768e232c769d4d6fad3dfa1187a.poster.avif?t=1759344332\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/18ccf768e232c769d4d6fad3dfa1187a.webm?t=1759344332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a variety of herbs essential for your remedies. Tend to their individual needs, from watering to soil nutrition, and relish the calming rhythm of caring for your crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Tranquil Biomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/266a77e5303799044a93df82d2b7af87.poster.avif?t=1759344332\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/266a77e5303799044a93df82d2b7af87.webm?t=1759344332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/266a77e5303799044a93df82d2b7af87.mp4?t=1759344332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through diverse biomes in search of rare ingredients with unique properties. Each area has its own beauty and secrets, waiting for you to uncover them at your leisure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the hustle and immerse yourself in a world of healing, exploration, and connection. Your journey to becoming the village\u2019s cherished healer begins here.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077170?t=1759344332","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/458bdf4505c5a7e34a53c97eb323b646d6b28774/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759344332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/f0cb26984f4bf97fa76791f3467faae2af7c692a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759344332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/f0cb26984f4bf97fa76791f3467faae2af7c692a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759344332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introductory cutscenes for four key NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided tutorial to introduce core gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greenhouse for growing and nurturing herbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infirmary where you craft remedies and treat adventurers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredient shop for purchasing herbal components</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorable forest biome with gatherable reagents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the Role of a Healer in a Relaxing Fantasy World</strong> In this charming life-simulation game, you\u2019ve been invited by the Adventurer\u2019s Guild to manage a cozy infirmary in a vibrant village. Unwind as you explore lush landscapes, nurture your garden, and connect with the community at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Soothing Remedies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/3aee08caa7701a2f985faf50abda7a42.poster.avif?t=1759344332\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/3aee08caa7701a2f985faf50abda7a42.webm?t=1759344332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help adventurers recover after their journeys by crafting remedies from unique ingredients. Match reagent properties to enhance their potency, or simply enjoy the process of experimenting with new combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Connections</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077170/extras/a64c08f22fc78893133645bded24ff3a.poster.